---
import { getOfficialHomeUrl, getOfficialUrl, site } from '../data/site'

const footerSocialLinks = site.socialLinks.filter((link) => link.showInFooter)
const officialHomeUrl = getOfficialHomeUrl()
---

<footer class="blog-footer-v2">
  <div class="blog-footer-shell">
    <div class="blog-footer-main">
      <div class="blog-footer-intro">
        <a class="blog-footer-brand" href="/blog/" aria-label={`${site.shortName} 공식 블로그 홈`}>
          <img src="/blog/logo-rect.png" alt="" />
          <span>
            <strong>{site.shortName}</strong>
            <small>공식 블로그</small>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p>{site.slogan}</p>
        <a class="blog-footer-switch" href={officialHomeUrl}>
          <span>동문회 소개와 참여 안내는 공식 홈페이지에서 확인하세요</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5"></path></svg>
        </a>
        <div class="blog-footer-socials" aria-label="SSAFYnity 소셜 채널">
          {footerSocialLinks.map((link) => (
            <a href={link.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{link.label}</a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <nav class="blog-footer-nav" aria-label="블로그 전체 메뉴">
        <section>
          <h2>블로그</h2>
          <div>
            <a href="/blog/category/notice/">공지</a>
            <a href="/blog/category/series/">연재</a>
            <a href="/blog/category/tech/">기술</a>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>운영 기록</h2>
          <div>
            <a href="/blog/category/journal/">일지</a>
            <a href="/blog/category/finance/">회비</a>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>참여 기록</h2>
          <div>
            <a href="/blog/category/club/">동아리</a>
            <a href="/blog/category/review/">후기</a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="blog-footer-meta">
      <div>
        <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} SSAFYnity. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>동문회의 사전 허락 없는 무단 크롤링, 스크래핑, 복제 및 재배포를 금합니다.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a href={getOfficialUrl(site.links.policyPaths.privacy)}>개인정보처리방침</a>
        <a href={getOfficialUrl(site.links.policyPaths.terms)}>이용약관</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .blog-footer-v2 {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(203, 213, 225, 0.16);
    background: #1e293b;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .blog-footer-shell {
    width: min(100% - 32px, 1180px);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .blog-footer-main {
    display: grid;
    gap: 48px;
    padding: 64px 0 52px;
  }

  .blog-footer-intro {
    max-width: 390px;
  }

  .blog-footer-brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 11px;
    color: #f8fafc;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .blog-footer-brand img {
    width: auto;
    height: 38px;
    padding: 4px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #f8fafc;
  }

  .blog-footer-brand span {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .blog-footer-brand strong {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .blog-footer-brand small {
    color: #cbd5e1;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .blog-footer-intro > p {
    max-width: 340px;
    margin: 24px 0 22px;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .blog-footer-switch {
    display: flex;
    max-width: 380px;
    min-height: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 11px 13px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(203, 213, 225, 0.28);
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: #f8fafc;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.45;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .blog-footer-switch:hover {
    border-color: #cbd5e1;
    background: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.06);
  }

  .blog-footer-switch svg {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.8;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .blog-footer-socials {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .blog-footer-socials a {
    min-height: 28px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 650;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .blog-footer-socials a:hover {
    color: #f8fafc;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .blog-footer-nav {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 34px 28px;
  }

  .blog-footer-nav h2 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: #f8fafc;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .blog-footer-nav section > div {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .blog-footer-nav a {
    width: fit-content;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.45;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .blog-footer-nav a:hover {
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .blog-footer-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column-reverse;
    gap: 22px;
    padding: 25px 0 calc(34px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(203, 213, 225, 0.18);
  }

  .blog-footer-meta > div:first-child {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .blog-footer-meta p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .blog-footer-meta > div:last-child {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .blog-footer-meta a {
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .blog-footer-nav {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .blog-footer-meta {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .blog-footer-main {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(340px, 1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr);
      gap: 80px;
      padding: 78px 0 64px;
    }
  }
</style>
